Package: taskmanager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Task Manager Developers <0FL01@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/0FL01/win10-task-manager-on-linux
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1,
 libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxcb1,
 libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libgl1, libegl1,
 libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers, hicolor-icon-theme, python3
Recommends: polkitd, pkexec
Conflicts: missioncenter, mission-center
Description: Task Manager for processes, performance, details and services
 Task Manager monitors system resources and services in a familiar tabbed interface.
 It is based on Mission Center and retains its statistics backend (magpie) and
 attribution to the Mission Center Developers.
